  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 171010,
    "RowId": 5100,
    "Text": "This way lies the first stage! By way of a warm-up, your opponents will be beasts and mammets!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 171118,
    "RowId": 5101,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 171130,
    "RowId": 5102,
    "Text": "The second stage begins! Gird your loins for a <i>beastly</i> encounter!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 171218,
    "RowId": 5103,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 171230,
    "RowId": 5104,
    "Text": "You have done well to come this far, but the hardest trials are yet to come. In the third stage, you must clash steel with seasoned gladiators!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 171386,
    "RowId": 5105,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 171398,
    "RowId": 5106,
    "Text": "Defeat the mammets"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 171430,
    "RowId": 5107,
    "Text": "Defeat Pyracmon"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 171458,
    "RowId": 5108,
    "Text": "Defeat the caged beasts"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 171494,
    "RowId": 5109,
    "Text": "Defeat the catoblepas"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 171526,
    "RowId": 5110,
    "Text": "Defeat the gladiators"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 171558,
    "RowId": 5111,
    "Text": "Complete the final test"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 171594,
    "RowId": 5112,
    "Text": "And so we arrive at the climactic ending! Victory belongs to the beauteous!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 171682,
    "RowId": 5113,
    "Text": "You may be able to stand with the best of the bloodsands, but how will you fare against the mightiest thaumaturge of the age?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 171818,
    "RowId": 5114,
    "Text": "There is no escaping the Absolute Bind!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 171870,
    "RowId": 5115,
    "Text": "Wh-What? But...how!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 171902,
    "RowId": 5116,
    "Text": "Run, my pretties, lest you feel the searing kiss of my magicks!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 171978,
    "RowId": 5117,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 171990,
    "RowId": 5118,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 172002,
    "RowId": 5119,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 172014,
    "RowId": 5120,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 172026,
    "RowId": 5200,
    "Text": "You trespass upon my domain, tainted of the Light!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 172090,
    "RowId": 5201,
    "Text": "Drink deep of the sea's bitter draught!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 172142,
    "RowId": 5202,
    "Text": "Mine is the power to cleanse all things! Naught can withstand the relentless onslaught of my waves!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 172254,
    "RowId": 5203,
    "Text": "You challenge me with trickery? Fools! Your mortal contrivances cannot quell the raging sea!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 172358,
    "RowId": 5204,
    "Text": "My waters...are stilled... This...this is the blessing of Light?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 172434,
    "RowId": 5205,
    "Text": "Elemental Conversion"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 172466,
    "RowId": 5206,
    "Text": "Your flesh shall feed my minions of the deep!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 172522,
    "RowId": 5207,
    "Text": "You challenge me with trickery?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 172566,
    "RowId": 5208,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 172578,
    "RowId": 5209,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 172590,
    "RowId": 5210,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 172602,
    "RowId": 5300,
    "Text": "Clear Runstop Frontblock"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 172638,
    "RowId": 5301,
    "Text": "Tiny Keys"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 172658,
    "RowId": 5302,
    "Text": "Liberate captured goblins"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 172694,
    "RowId": 5303,
    "Text": "Clear Brayflox's Drossdump"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 172734,
    "RowId": 5304,
    "Text": "Open Swiftmake Checkgates"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 172770,
    "RowId": 5305,
    "Text": "Knowings of cheesemake is gobbie secret!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 172822,
    "RowId": 5306,
    "Text": "All cheese recipes are belong to Illuminati!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 172878,
    "RowId": 5307,
    "Text": "Shkoh! Target is eyecatched! All hands, forcetake Brayflox!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 172950,
    "RowId": 5308,
    "Text": "Illuminati brainfruit is frontmost! Uplanders have no chance to survive! "
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 173034,
    "RowId": 5309,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 173046,
    "RowId": 5310,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 173058,
    "RowId": 5400,
    "Text": "Clear Halcyon Court"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 173090,
    "RowId": 5401,
    "Text": "Clear the Tower of White"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 173126,
    "RowId": 5402,
    "Text": "Defeat Diabolos"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 173154,
    "RowId": 5403,
    "Text": "Who dares set foot within my domain? The wretched white mages of Amdapor?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 173238,
    "RowId": 5404,
    "Text": "To face me is to face thy deepest, darkest nightmares!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 173306,
    "RowId": 5405,
    "Text": "Not even in eternal sleep shalt thou be free from the terror of my weaving!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 173394,
    "RowId": 5406,
    "Text": "My long slumber...hath weakened me..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 173442,
    "RowId": 5407,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 173454,
    "RowId": 5408,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 173466,
    "RowId": 5409,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 173478,
    "RowId": 5410,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 173490,
    "RowId": 5501,
    "Text": "来たな冒険者、お前に勝って武器をいただくぜ！\nゆくぞ、エンキドゥ！\u3000我が心の友よ！"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 173626,
    "RowId": 5502,
    "Text": "Fine! I admit it!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 173654,
    "RowId": 5503,
    "Text": "Fighting all eight of you..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 173694,
    "RowId": 5504,
    "Text": "Is just too much for me..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 173734,
    "RowId": 5505,
    "Text": "NOT! Ha, I lied!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 173762,
    "RowId": 5506,
    "Text": "Have at thee!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 173786,
    "RowId": 5507,
    "Text": "Ehhh!? Why, I've been had! This is far from the strongest of spears! I feel so betrayed!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 173886,
    "RowId": 5508,
    "Text": "Goodness gracious! I, uh, just remembered something!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 173950,
    "RowId": 5509,
    "Text": "Go on, Enkidu! It's toad─your favorite!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 174002,
    "RowId": 5510,
    "Text": "I must say, I quite enjoy these tussles. I feel we've gained an understanding─"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 174094,
    "RowId": 5511,
    "Text": "An understanding that I will pound you silly! Ha ha!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 174158,
    "RowId": 5512,
    "Text": "Urgh! I won't go down so easily!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 174202,
    "RowId": 5513,
    "Text": "これなるはエオルゼアいちの強者……\nその名も、剣豪ギルガメッシュ！"
  },
  {
