    "RowOffset": 179134,
    "RowId": 6600,
    "Text": "Defeat Karlabos"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 179162,
    "RowId": 6601,
    "Text": "Clear the Pull"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 179190,
    "RowId": 6602,
    "Text": "Defeat Captain Madison"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 179226,
    "RowId": 6603,
    "Text": "Defeat First Mate Haerstymm"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 179266,
    "RowId": 6604,
    "Text": "Defeat the kraken"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 179294,
    "RowId": 6605,
    "Text": "We got usselves some company, lads! In the name o' Lord Leviathan...kill 'em an' make 'em dead!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 179402,
    "RowId": 6606,
    "Text": "Look sharp, ye useless bloody whoresons!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 179454,
    "RowId": 6607,
    "Text": "Kill 'em, I said! What part o' that don't ye understand!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 179522,
    "RowId": 6608,
    "Text": "Are we pirates or spineless swivin' jellyfish!? Fight harder!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 179594,
    "RowId": 6609,
    "Text": "Ugh... I'm sorry, Cap'n..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 179634,
    "RowId": 6610,
    "Text": "<i>You</i>! Yer that bastard 'venturer from afore! It's yer fault we're abominations!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 179734,
    "RowId": 6611,
    "Text": "Ye want Lord Leviathan to punish us again!? Get yer poxy arses over here, all o' ye!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 179830,
    "RowId": 6612,
    "Text": "W-We can't fail! Not again!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 179870,
    "RowId": 6613,
    "Text": "Argh, that bloody hurt!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 179906,
    "RowId": 6614,
    "Text": "Ack, sod this...\nYou lot, take care o' the rest!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 179970,
    "RowId": 6615,
    "Text": "I'll be waitin' fer ye with a surprise...assumin' ye live long enough, that is!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 180062,
    "RowId": 6616,
    "Text": "Die, ye swivin' whoresons! Yaaargh!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 180110,
    "RowId": 6617,
    "Text": "H-How the hells did I miss!? That's <i>balls</i>, I tell ye!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 180186,
    "RowId": 6700,
    "Text": "Save the fleeing tonberries"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 180226,
    "RowId": 6701,
    "Text": "Defeat Frumious Koheel Ja"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 180262,
    "RowId": 6702,
    "Text": "Breach the defensive line"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 180298,
    "RowId": 6703,
    "Text": "Defeat Slithy Zolool Ja"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 180334,
    "RowId": 6704,
    "Text": "Free the imprisoned tonberries"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 180378,
    "RowId": 6705,
    "Text": "Clear the Bellows"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 180406,
    "RowId": 6706,
    "Text": "Defeat Manxome Molaa Ja Ja"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 180446,
    "RowId": 6707,
    "Text": "空枠"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 180466,
    "RowId": 6708,
    "Text": "Adventurers? Here?\nWhy lookout no catch you!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 180526,
    "RowId": 6709,
    "Text": "You brave to defy Silverscales─brave or stupid!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 180586,
    "RowId": 6710,
    "Text": "Burn!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 180602,
    "RowId": 6711,
    "Text": "Honor to you who slay Koheel Ja!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 180646,
    "RowId": 6712,
    "Text": "Much honor in death by old magicks of Mamool Ja!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 180706,
    "RowId": 6713,
    "Text": "H-Honor to you who slay...me..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 180750,
    "RowId": 6714,
    "Text": "We smash them, Brother?\n<i>Into pulp, yesss, into pulp</i>!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 180826,
    "RowId": 6715,
    "Text": "I no hold back, Brother!\n<i>Yesss, kill them─kill them now</i>!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 180910,
    "RowId": 6716,
    "Text": "Brother, I d-d-die?\n<i>Me too, Brothe...</i>"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 180974,
    "RowId": 6717,
    "Text": "Run, run, run!\nNone can quench firelit spear!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 181034,
    "RowId": 6718,
    "Text": "Brother, they doomed with no heali─\n<i>Shhh! Keep tricksy secret to yourself</i>!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 181134,
    "RowId": 6719,
    "Text": "Sick ones make sickness, Brother!\n<i>Ehehehe, so badly will they ache</i>!"
  },
