  {
    "RowOffset": 184982,
    "RowId": 7700,
    "Text": "Defeat the demon tome"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 185014,
    "RowId": 7701,
    "Text": "Defeat Byblos"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 185038,
    "RowId": 7702,
    "Text": "Defeat the Everliving Bibliotaph"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 185082,
    "RowId": 7703,
    "Text": "I am undone...but my master's seal is broken!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 185138,
    "RowId": 7704,
    "Text": "Argh, oil everywhere! You shall pay dearly, accursed mortals! "
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 185214,
    "RowId": 7705,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 185226,
    "RowId": 7706,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 185238,
    "RowId": 7707,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 185250,
    "RowId": 7708,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 185262,
    "RowId": 7709,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 185274,
    "RowId": 7710,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 185286,
    "RowId": 7800,
    "Text": "I shall not toy with you as does Lahabrea!\nWitness the terrible might of a true servant of Zodiark!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 185402,
    "RowId": 7801,
    "Text": "Writhing powers of ruination!\nFrom the deepest pits of the abyss I summon thee!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 185498,
    "RowId": 7802,
    "Text": "Insatiable hunger of the void!\nDevour all light and return this world to perfect darkness!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 185602,
    "RowId": 7803,
    "Text": "By Zodiark's name I command thee!\nRiver of time, mire mine enemy in thy sluggish flow!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 185702,
    "RowId": 7804,
    "Text": "You shall wither in the merciless embrace of eternity!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 185770,
    "RowId": 7805,
    "Text": "But...you are shorn of Her blessing!\nHow do you yet resist me!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 185850,
    "RowId": 7806,
    "Text": "Impossible!\nHas he power over...time itself!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 185910,
    "RowId": 7807,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 185922,
    "RowId": 7808,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 185934,
    "RowId": 7809,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 185946,
    "RowId": 7810,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 185958,
    "RowId": 7900,
    "Text": "To my side, Enkidu! The battle is joined!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 186010,
    "RowId": 7901,
    "Text": "Owww! It hurts! It hurts!\nEnkidu! Your master wants for succor!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 186090,
    "RowId": 7902,
    "Text": "Fight on, Enkidu, my ever faithful─hm!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 186142,
    "RowId": 7903,
    "Text": "You'll get no quarter from me this time.\nHave at thee!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 186210,
    "RowId": 7904,
    "Text": "You have some skill, I'll give you that...\nBut Gilgamesh has only just begun to fight!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 186310,
    "RowId": 7905,
    "Text": "Most impressive!\nVery well─I, too, shall fight with all my strength!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 186394,
    "RowId": 7906,
    "Text": "No! The mighty Gilgamesh will not be defeated!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 186454,
    "RowId": 7907,
    "Text": "Enkidu! Are the bonds of our friendship so fragile!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 186518,
    "RowId": 7908,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 186530,
    "RowId": 7909,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 186542,
    "RowId": 7910,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 186554,
    "RowId": 8000,
    "Text": "We claim victory this day, or Ishgard falls! Accept the Fury into your heart, and defend this bridge with your life's blood!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 186690,
    "RowId": 8001,
    "Text": "Slings and arrows shall avail us little against this foe.\nReady the cannons!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 186782,
    "RowId": 8002,
    "Text": "They seek to swarm the healers!\nFocus your attacks on the dragonflies!"
  }
]